     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello everyone,<div><br></div><div>I have to compile an rmd file in order to obtain an HTML file.</div><div><br></div><div>When I compile it with RStudio, everything works well... but when I use <i>rmarkdown::render </i>or the <i>knitr::knit2html</i>  functions, I get some dependencies problems!</div><div><br></div><div>I need to load the <i>filehash </i>package in order to load some data in the codechunk.</div><div><br></div><div>Someone knows which are the parameters used by RStudio when it compiles an rdm file?</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Here I report an <u>example</u> of my R code chunk in the rmd file:</div><div><br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">```{r eval=TRUE, echo=TRUE}</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"> library(&quot;filehash&quot;)<br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">source(&quot;MyCachingFunctions.R&quot;)</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><a href=\"http://db.file.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://db.file.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792354732535000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1a4vjZFbCEvB7NJ3ixJGuR\">db.file.name</a> &lt;- &quot;db_file_name&quot;</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">Cache.Path &lt;- &quot;cache/path&quot; </blockquote></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">cache.db.obj &lt;- InitCachingDb(<a href=\"http://db.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://db.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792354732535000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0YBSs_SbZZzLRdci1Z6K4q\">db.name</a> = <a href=\"http://db.file.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://db.file.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792354732535000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1a4vjZFbCEvB7NJ3ixJGuR\">db.file.name</a>, db.path = Cache.Path)</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">annotation.obj &lt;- LoadCachedObject(cpa.cache.db.obj, &quot;annotation_data&quot;)</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">```</blockquote></blockquote><div>The file MyCachingFunctions.R contains the <i>InitCachingDb</i> and the <i>LoadCachedObject </i>functions.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Compiling it, I get the following error, related to the filehash package:</div><div><br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:11.96px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre\">## Error in (function (classes, fdef, mtable) : unable to find an inherited method for function &#39;dbFetch&#39; for signature &#39;&quot;filehashDB1&quot;&#39;</span><br></blockquote><div><br></div><div>The error comes out on the <i>LoadCachedObject </i>function call...<br></div><div><br></div><div>Thank you in advance,</div><div>Inzirio</div><div><br></div><div>p.s. when I compile the rmd <b><u>only rstudio</u></b> produces this output when loading the filehash package</div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;padding:9.5px;line-height:1.42857;color:rgb(51,51,51);word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);border-radius:4px\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:inherit;color:inherit;border-radius:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">## Loading required package: filehash</code></pre><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;padding:9.5px;line-height:1.42857;color:rgb(51,51,51);word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);border-radius:4px\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:inherit;color:inherit;border-radius:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">## filehash: Simple Key-Value Database (2.3 2015-08-12)</code></pre></blockquote></div>"
